cards.referenceText:
First, I will keep calm and not be panic. Keeping control of the aircraft is the most important thing in this situation;
Then, I would follow the checklist;
Third, I will contact ATC and request emergency descent and priority landing.
Besides, if there is passenger injured, I would request medical assistance.

The aircraft may lose speed and altitude rapidly;
It is difficult to control the aircraft in moderate to severe turbulence.
Severe turbulence may even cause structural damage and passenger injuries.

cards.referenceTextZh:
飞机可能迅速失去速度和高度;
在中等到严重的颠簸情况下，飞行员很难控制飞机。
严重颠簸甚至可能造成飞机结构损坏和乘客受伤。

cards.referenceText:
Keeping control of the aircraft is the most important thing in this situation;
Then, we should report the situation to ATC.
Besides, we will make a PA to inform the cabin crew and passengers to fasten their seat belts.
